<title>UK: BOE allots 450 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 450 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 450 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 398 million stg in bills outright and 52 million stg in repos to July 23. The Bank earlier forecast a money market shortage of 600 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
